% Goal

Implement and maintain `brain/api/api_static_assets.py` as the Serves brain/web/*.js and *.css. SERVE .js AS text/javascript AND .css AS text/css FROM A LITERAL TWO-ENTRY MAP, not mimetypes.guess_type: guess_type reads /etc/apache2/mime.types and seven other system files at module init, so its answer is this box's answer rather than a contract, and MDN is explicit that scripts served with any other MIME type may not run while CSS sent as text/plain or application/octet-stream is IGNORED. Use guess_type only as a fallback for other extensions. This is the second silent failure mode on the same path as the arrange.js filename fix: right file, wrong Content-Type, fetched and refused, nav button never appears, nothing in the server log. SCRIPT MODEL: modules 32-35 are ES modules loaded with <script type="module">, chosen because 33/34/35 all import 32 and classic scripts would require a global namespace plus load-order discipline in playlist.html; same-origin here so the CORS requirement on module scripts is moot, and module scripts are deferred by default. Path confined to WEB_ROOT via Path.resolve() then containment; '..' and absolute paths rejected. ETag plus 304 with the required headers on Not Modified. A startup assertion (or test) checks that every <script src="/web/..."> in playlist.html names a file on disk AND that this module serves it with a JavaScript MIME type.

